<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:20:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>CME E-Mini 期权在开盘混乱期间短暂暂停</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/cme-e-mini-options-briefly-paused-during-chaotic-opening-session</link><description>周三股市开盘后，由于交易所风险管理系统启动，交易者无法进行 E-mini S&amp;P 500 指数期权交易，导致交易者在抛售开始和波动性增加期间无法进场或退出头寸。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/cme-e-mini-options-briefly-paused-during-chaotic-opening-session'&gt;CME E-Mini 期权在开盘混乱期间短暂暂停&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CME E-Mini Options Briefly Paused During Chaotic Opening Session&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/cme-e-mini-options-briefly-paused-during-chaotic-opening-session</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:37:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>陆军炸毁危险物品，最担心的事情并未成为现实</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/army-blows-up-hazardous-material-in-iowa-video</link><description>陆军炸毁了储存在爱荷华州一处设施中的五吨危险材料，早期迹象表明规划者已经避免了周围社区上空飘浮的大量有毒铅云的最坏情况。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/army-blows-up-hazardous-material-in-iowa-video'&gt;陆军炸毁危险物品，最担心的事情并未成为现实&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Army Blows Up Hazardous Material With Worst Fears Unrealized&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/army-blows-up-hazardous-material-in-iowa-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:51:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Bounces Off Tech-Driven Lows as Dip Buyers Emerge&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</link><description>铜、铝和锡都加剧了周二金属的大幅抛售，因为科技股扩大了跌幅，交易员们为美国通胀数据做好准备，这些数据将为美联储下一步的利率举措提供依据。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation'&gt;人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Enters Bear-Market Territory as AI Fears Drive Sentiment&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:57:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Pare AI-Driven Losses as Buyers Step In: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>